      "writtenOn": "2016-11-28T18:00:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For both uuid and fernet tokens, deleting a group, with no role assignment and users in the group, will result in a revocation entry of each user\u0027s user_id. This fix changes that for both token providers so that revocation entries aren\u0027t filled from deleting a group if the group was never given a role for anything.",
